<title>JAPAN: Ohtori - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Ohtori - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  1.66		vs	    3.13</p>
<p> Operating   loss 320 million	 vs	prft 566 million</p>
<p> Current     loss 469 million	 vs	prft 342 million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 471 million	 vs	prft 170 million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 15.91 yen	  vs     prft 5.77 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     30 million	  vs	  30 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Ohtori Corporation is a specialist maker of woven cloth for jeans.</p>
</text>
